GRAMMAR.md §7.1: studio names no package; E1012 is reported with every check.
-- args --
check
a
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  studio: studio
}
-- a/a.canon --
package a
-- want --
[exit 1]
[stdout]
error[E1012]  project.canon:3:11
  studio package "studio" does not exist

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
[stderr]
